# Environment variables

## Chrysty platform / SSO

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHRYSTY_API_URL=https://api.chrysty.dev
CHRYSTY_API_URL=https://api.chrysty.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
```

## Ask Chrysty Live embed (Astra iframe host)

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_ASTRA_EMBED_URL=https://chrysty.chrysty.dev
```

## Content generation (server-only)

```bash
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GENERATION_INTERNAL_SECRET=
APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

See [docs/ask-chrysty-sibling-apps.md](./docs/ask-chrysty-sibling-apps.md) for embed integration.
